# GEMINI_API_KEY enables the "AI Advice" tactical advisor feature.
# Get a key from https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#
# This is now used SERVER-SIDE ONLY, by the Cloudflare Pages Function at
# web/functions/api/tactical-advice.ts — it is never bundled into the browser
# and stays invisible to site visitors.
#
# Local dev: create web/.dev.vars with GEMINI_API_KEY=... and run
#   npx wrangler pages dev -- npm run dev
# (this serves the /functions routes alongside the Vite dev server).
#
# Production: set GEMINI_API_KEY as a secret in the Cloudflare dashboard
# under Workers & Pages -> your project -> Settings -> Environment variables.
